  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 909.01 Proceedings. Any adjudicative proceedings, including hearings which are necessary to resolve any contested issue relative to a phase II program provider or a certified instructor, shall be conducted pursuant to He-C 200.\n\nSource. #7058, eff 7-21-99; ss by #8902, INTERIM, eff 7-13-07, EXPIRED: 1-9-08\n\nNew. #9082, eff 1-30-08 (from He-A 909.02)",
